app.vulkan.no_loader = schist: kāore he pūuta Vulkan i tēnei pūnaha, nō reira kāore he mea hei tā pikitia.\n\nKa tā pikitia a Schist mā Vulkan, ā, kāore anō a `libvulkan.so.1` kia tāutahia.\nMe whai te pūuta me tētahi atekōkiri:\n\n    Arch, CachyOS, Omarchy    sudo pacman -S vulkan-icd-loader vulkan-driver\n    Debian, Ubuntu, Mint      sudo apt install libvulkan1 mesa-vulkan-drivers\n    Fedora, RHEL              sudo dnf install vulkan-loader mesa-vulkan-drivers\n
app.vulkan.override_missing = schist: kāore i reira te atekōkiri Vulkan e tohungia ana e tēnei wātū.\n\nKua tautuhia a {var}, ā, mā te tautuhi ka *whakakapi* i te rapunga a te pūuta\nmo ngā atekōkiri, kāore e tāpiri ki taua rapunga. Nō reira ko ēnei kōnae kāore\ne tīariari ana te rārangi atekōkiri katoa — ā, kāore rawa he atekōkiri e kitea\ne ngā papatono Vulkan katoa o tēnei wātū, ahakoa te maha kua tāutahia:\n\n{missing}\n    {var}={value}\n\nTohua tētahi whakapuakitanga e tīariari ana — ka waiho e ngā atekōkiri tāuta ā rātou\nki /usr/share/vulkan/icd.d — wetohia rānei taua tautuhinga kia rapu ai te pūuta.\nMēnā nā tētahi kōnae whirihoranga tēnei i tautuhi (te `env =` a Hyprland, tētahi\ntāpiritanga systemd environment.d, tētahi kōtaha anga rānei), me whakarerekē ki reira,\nā, me takiuru hou kia tae te panoni ki ngā mea e whakahaere kē ana.\n
app.vulkan.override_note = \nKua tautuhia a {var} ki {value}, ā, ka whakakapi tēnā i tā te pūuta ake\nrapunga: ki te kore tētahi o aua whakapuakitanga mō tēnei mīhini, ko te wete\ni taua tautuhinga te mahi tuatahi hei whakamātau.\n
app.vulkan.no_driver = schist: kāore he atekōkiri Vulkan kua tāutahia, nō reira kāore he mea hei tā pikitia ki runga.\n\nKa tā pikitia a Schist mā Vulkan. Kua tāutahia te pūuta, engari e kī ana kāore\nhe atekōkiri — kāore tētahi i rēhita ki ngā wāhi e rua e rapua ana:\n\n{dirs}\n\nHe mea tuku motuhake te pūuta i ngā atekōkiri, nō reira ko te nuinga he mōkī kotahi\ne ngaro ana.\n\nTāutahia te mea mō te GPU o tēnei mīhini:\n\n    Arch, CachyOS, Omarchy    sudo pacman -S vulkan-driver\n    Debian, Ubuntu, Mint      sudo apt install mesa-vulkan-drivers\n    Fedora, RHEL              sudo dnf install mesa-vulkan-drivers\n\nKei te atekōkiri rangatōpū a NVIDIA tōna ake (`nvidia-utils` ki Arch,\n`nvidia-driver` ki Debian). Ki tētahi mīhini mariko, ki tētahi wāhi rānei kāore\nhe atekōkiri GPU hei tāuta, ko te pūtā pika ā-pūmanawa te mea ka mahi:\n`vulkan-swrast` ki Arch, he wāhanga o `mesa-vulkan-drivers` ki wāhi kē. He\npuhoi, engari ka tīmata.\n{overridden}
app.vulkan.no_device = schist: kua tāutahia tētahi atekōkiri Vulkan, engari kāore e tuku pūrere hei tā pikitia ki runga.\n\nTērā pea kāore te atekōkiri e tautoko i tēnei GPU, kāore rānei e taea te toro atu —\nmā SSH, i roto rānei i tētahi ipu, he mea ngaro auau a /dev/dri. Mā\n`vulkaninfo --summary` e whakaatu ngā mea e kitea ana e te pūuta.\n\nKi te kore rawa he GPU o tēnei mīhini, ka taea e te pūtā pika ā-pūmanawa te tā\npikitia: `vulkan-swrast` ki Arch, he wāhanga o `mesa-vulkan-drivers`\nki Debian me Fedora.\n
app.vulkan.skip_hint = Hei tīmata tonu i a Schist kia rahua i tōna ake ara, tautuhia {var}=1.
